{"id":"wb-6-420","name":"晋祠庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"晋祠庙","text":"晋祠庙位于中国山西省晋中市灵石县静升镇马和村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n晋祠庙始建于元至正年间，明清多次修葺。庙坐北朝南，占地1374平方米，中轴线上正殿、献殿和戏台，两侧有钟鼓楼和偏殿，其中正殿和献殿为元代建筑，余为明清所建。正殿建于元至正三年（1343年），面阔三间，进深四椽，前檐设廊，悬山顶，梁架结构为四椽栿对后乳栿用三柱。献殿平面呈正方形，单檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%8B%E7%A5%A0%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91456876,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91456876","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3e6959be1271e0a068d94a62.jpg","title":"Lingshi_Jinci_Miao_2013.08.24_16-16-13.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lingshi_Jinci_Miao_2013.08.24_16-16-13.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/Lingshi_Jinci_Miao_2013.08.24_16-16-13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"灵石县马和村晋祠庙 ——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}